          "kicker": "Squad selection",
          "heading": "Jake White names four uncapped players in first Fiji squad",
          "body": "Jake White's first Fiji squad, named ahead of Saturday's 34-28 win over Japan in Tokyo, included four uncapped players. Nacani Boginisoko and Aporosa Vuniyayawa started, while Peni Naruma and Kavekini Boselawa were named among the replacements. White picked no Europe-based players for the match, and said the calibre of player picked from the islands could make Fiji a force at next year's World Cup."
