          "body": "Jack van Poortvliet has committed his future to Leicester Tigers, the club he grew up supporting. The Tigers vice-captain has made 118 appearances since his 2019 debut and was part of the 2021-22 squad that won the Gallagher PREM. The 27-cap England international has also earned an Elite Player Squad contract for 2026-27. He added: \"It was a pretty easy decision to stay. I love it here and long may that continue.\""
