          "kicker": "Tribute weekend",
          "heading": "French rugby observes minute's applause for 17-year-old Cléa Menier this weekend",
          "body": "Cléa Menier, a 17-year-old back row for Union du Bassin Marmandais, died in hospital after what her club called an \"accident\" in an amateur under-18s match against Agen Agglo Rugby on Saturday. The French Rugby Federation says a minute's applause will be held before every professional and amateur match in France this weekend, and that the tribute is agreed with her family. Neither the club nor the federation has disclosed the nature of her injury."
