          "body": "Ulster's 34-26 defeat at Loftus Versfeld was a day for Stuart McCloskey to make his case. The centre assisted one try and then bundled over for another to get Ulster within striking distance, and Planet Rugby rated him 8. Its writer calls it a 'statement performance' that will put Andy Farrell on notice just before the Nations Championship. The piece says he 'was aggressive and physical in contact' throughout."
