          "body": "Italy's points record is the story the table tells most bluntly. Across their three games so far they have scored 37 points and conceded 131, a points difference of -94. The most recent of those, a 10-57 loss to Australia in Round three, accounts for the largest single share of that total. Their next match is Round four against South Africa, the side who beat them 32-14 at home in November 2025, and the log leaves little room for comfort."
