          "heading": "Tom English says Darcy Graham is working back into Scotland's wing picture",
          "body": "Darcy Graham is working back into contention, but Tom English's BBC Sport reader Q&A this week points to a hard choice in Scotland's back three. English says Jamie Dobie and Kyle Steyn are the two most consistent wings right now, with Kyle Rowe an inch away, and sees obvious logic in Dobie covering two positions from the bench. That would leave Graham outside the 23, which English describes as a hard call."
